From 05f23d76f1b78e77149630ca7d16ea98fccadad4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 01:33:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Port the Fabric module to 26.3

LevelRenderer.render lost its DeltaTracker and model-view parameters in
26.3; the model view NeoForge hands its frame graph event is
cameraState.viewRotationMatrix, so FrameGraphMixin reads that. The main
pass's lambda was split into executeSolid and executeClassicTransparency,
whose calls now take the open RenderPass; LevelStagesMixin wraps the same
calls NeoForge posts its stage events after. AfterLevelMixin targets the
26.3 LevelRenderer.render descriptor. fabric.mod.json accepted only
Minecraft below 26.3.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019Rd9hEeedfauYVxKQg5jqi
